  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Denna insats g&#xe4;ller en organisations&#xf6;versyn av SAfAIDS. Denna g&#xf6;rs nu eftersom ambassadens nuvarande avtal l&#xf6;per ut i juni 2017 och vi nu granskar ett nytt f&#xf6;rslag fr&#xe5;n SAfAIDS f&#xf6;r perioden efter juni 2017.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution is for an Organisational assessment of SAfAIDS. This is being done now since the current agreement ends in June 2017 and the Embassy is assessing a new proposal from SAfAIDS for the period after June 2017.</narrative>
  </description>
